  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nepal Pro-poor Urban Regeneration Pilot</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The PDO is to (a) contribute to improving the living conditions of poor and vulnerable households in selected wards of the historiccore of Lalitpur City by piloting urban regeneration activities and (b) demonstrate the feasibility of an integrated urban regeneration approach to decision-makers in the Kathmandu Valley.</narrative>
  </description>
